  "details": "1 be in a vrchat instance\n\n2 have bad internet\n\n3 wait for bad ping spike\n\nThe issue is I get really bad ping to the point where I temporarily disconnect from the internet at random for 2 seconds sometimes, and this causes vrchat to get suspicious of me and ban me from any instance I was in, I cannot rejoin even if I made the instance. I have to make a new instance, if I try to rejoin the instance it just sends me to a new one instead. I'm not sure if this can be reproduced by anyone else, but when I check vrchat while it happens, my ping can go from 60 to 4000 to 400000 before back down to around 120 and it just kicks me. I do not know what the current build number is but I'm on the latest version for steam, I assume that is the correct build number that I put in.",
